<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts natural gas stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts natural gas stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co analyst David Fleischer has cut his rating for the natural gas stocks sector to market weight from overweight, a source at the firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Fleischer was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
